  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "放炮仔"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>蕭文興</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿爸滿面笑容kā規kuānn長lò-sò ê聯炮仔囥tī塗跤，有夠長--ê，kánn-ná beh伸到中華路hit爿去！伊ànn腰點to̍h炮仔，火光隨tī面前炸--開，紅色ê炮仔hu親像雨點掖tī規條街仔路，炮仔煙tshìng過規身軀，照出伊笑kah kiōng-beh píng--過ê驕傲。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮tī台中市太平路ê低厝仔是鐵厝起--ê，厝頂下面鋪幾若沿竹bi̍h仔隔熱遮雨，一家口仔七个人ku tī大約12坪ê違章建築內底。一欉鳳凰木生tī客廳中ng suan出厝頂，雨水順樹箍流入厝內是sù常ê代誌。簡單ê廚房內底iáu有細條水溝仔nǹg過牆仔，不sám時仔ē聽著niáu鼠leh tsông來tsông去ê聲。1970年代ê散赤家庭就是生做án-ne。所以阿爸特別beh kā炮仔囥tī阮兜頭前來大聲放！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">炮仔ê引線漸漸燒透，聲勢mā愈來愈iām。雖bóng伊耳空無好，仝款感受著跤底地面leh tín動。He tín動ná親像是leh對伊回應，因為in後生阿興保送甄試考tiâu台北工專，是in學校機械科ê唯一，mā是阮蕭--家ê第一。空氣中漸漸湠--開ê火藥味，hōo伊一種莫名ê安慰，安慰伊做一世人廣告kha̋ng-páng ê艱苦，為伊長期khû tī塗跤寫廣告字、畫油漆ê操勞做美好干證。今仔日ê錄取通知單，kā tsiah-nī濟年來ê生活壓力kah責任，做一擺tháu放。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">炮仔聲響起，厝邊隔壁hònn玄來問是啥mih代誌？知影原因了後就直直呵咾講：「阿興有夠gâu」、恭喜「阿興第一名」！因為阿爸lio̍h仔臭耳聾聽無啥有，kan-na一直tìm頭講多謝，我顛倒pì-sù bih tī厝內，歹勢出來kah人sio借問，ná像是leh做歹代誌，事實上是歡喜kah，心肝頭暢kah phi̍h-pho̍k跳！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">炮仔放--過了後，我開始煩惱揣無步，因為萬外箍ê註冊費，m̄知beh按佗位來？而且若去台北讀冊所費koh沉重。無法度，beh食胡蠅tio̍h-ài家己hap，到尾只好放棄讀台北工專，改去考m̄免錢koh有公費thang領ê師範學校。好佳哉有考tiâu。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿爸仝款sì-kè kā人展：「阮兜阿興tio̍h狀元--lah！」只是tsit改就無買炮仔--ah。M̄-koh pi-pi-pia̍k-pia̍k ê炮仔聲suah tī阿爸ê心內繼續響幾若十年； tsiok久tsiok久lóng bē恬--去。&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjM3EcBO-ogQtq-14qUpJDDSmwNJw74_nLlI-JUBlIHPZiAntzI9zBh_do7q2bnal_IG-I1eSAZ3Hs4UGVytDJR0loQ6tO3yp5x6fjz-qrovsDBNmWOGggGCy7B2gc-YItLHSvUUf8Z8e6fK278eMqwq-EyM86b7IX3WCsI6NlOuAc8IVu5WH7qTkofBmV6/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1369%E6%9C%9F_37.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjM3EcBO-ogQtq-14qUpJDDSmwNJw74_nLlI-JUBlIHPZiAntzI9zBh_do7q2bnal_IG-I1eSAZ3Hs4UGVytDJR0loQ6tO3yp5x6fjz-qrovsDBNmWOGggGCy7B2gc-YItLHSvUUf8Z8e6fK278eMqwq-EyM86b7IX3WCsI6NlOuAc8IVu5WH7qTkofBmV6/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1369%E6%9C%9F_37.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><!--more--><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5nvVxXNbsB16fakDS9BHZV92LSv5LpwZpFvjNgl7lHlcI0Ic2ESoJgJp45Fa0jt7T5-OfXIwMAzUdN6kepsdb2U1PnGCfE-LA9S0lP-4MWZhe89bXSuZQx3ijA8ncIFram-Q-9GJdDHHpqLXyPyTg3va1enY-2NVx4aOm7r3KmrMa0MeP2rN1uS0ByYX-/s1424/369%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5nvVxXNbsB16fakDS9BHZV92LSv5LpwZpFvjNgl7lHlcI0Ic2ESoJgJp45Fa0jt7T5-OfXIwMAzUdN6kepsdb2U1PnGCfE-LA9S0lP-4MWZhe89bXSuZQx3ijA8ncIFram-Q-9GJdDHHpqLXyPyTg3va1enY-2NVx4aOm7r3KmrMa0MeP2rN1uS0ByYX-/w450-h640/369%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\